5. ARCGIS ADAPTER
The ArcGIS Adapter shall be the primary integration boundary between OneDraft and ArcGIS services.
The adapter shall provide normalized OneDraft interfaces for:
Dataset discovery
Layer discovery
Feature queries
Spatial queries
Metadata retrieval
Feature retrieval
Feature creation where authorized
Feature updates where authorized
Synchronization
Service health
The application shall not distribute ArcGIS-specific logic throughout the OneDraft domain layer.

6. PROVIDER ABSTRACTION
The implementation shall use a provider abstraction.
SpatialProvider
      │
 ┌────┼────────────┐
 │    │            │
ArcGIS Provider   Future Providers
ArcGIS shall be the first implementation.
Future providers shall be capable of connecting through the same spatial-provider contract.

