 ├── structures
 ├── spatial_entities
 ├── spatial_datasets
 ├── spatial_layers
 ├── spatial_relationships
 ├── spatial_versions
 └── spatial_provenance
Spatial persistence shall remain integrated with the existing OneDraft transaction model.

