53. RETRY POLICY
Transient external failures shall be retried according to controlled policy.
Retryable conditions may include:
Temporary network failure
Service timeout
Rate limiting
Temporary provider unavailability
Non-retryable conditions shall terminate immediately with explicit failure state.

54. RATE LIMITING
The ArcGIS integration shall respect provider-specific request limits.
