External GIS authentication shall be isolated within the integration layer.
Credentials or tokens shall be stored using the OneDraft secrets architecture.
The application shall support the authentication mechanisms permitted by the selected ArcGIS deployment and subscription configuration.
Credentials shall never be persisted in ordinary project records.

